pub const ABOUT : str = "igla-coder-gpu: PAIRED A/B of two selfcheck arms at one seed -- the causal protocol (skill paired-ab-tiny-model; without SC_SEED a 30-item pass count is NOISE, see research/REPAIR_BODY_2026-09-29.md).   tri tc-pair <SEED> [BUDGET=15] [ITEMS=30] Env: PAIR_A / PAIR_B = env-string for arm B's EXTRA knobs, e.g.   PAIR_B=\"SC_REPAIR=1\"        (treatment: repair on)   PAIR_B=\"SC_EARLY=1\"         (treatment: early abort)   PAIR_B=\"SC_PROBE=1 SC_REDRAW=3\"  (probe abort + kill-and-restart) Arm A is always the bare base. Both arms get SC_SEED, same rounds, same items; output dirs results/t27/pair<SEED>_{a,b}. Prints the summary diff + paired-body identity count (0 unexplained = causal).";
